abstract: "Band-limited lognormal heterogeneity atlas (24 regimes, 1,536 held-out realizations, 3,264 evaluations), MMS-verified TPFA finite-volume reference solver, U-Net/FNO/PINN solver families, pre-training roughness screening rules, two-batch off-grid blind validation (12 regimes), multi-seed stability controls, Pollock streamline transport evaluation, and one-cycle AMG a posteriori diagnostics and defect correction."
